            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "Against the &quot;smart germs&quot; of tomorrow's biowarfare, nanites will be our drone soldiers, but for how long? Enter the fluid living world of Cell (built from &quot;dynamic voxels&quot;) to witness the emergence of new life: YOU, a nanobot who shoots deadly colloids, builds defenses and supercharged weapons, deciphers enemy nanotech -- and, by design, learns.",
            "about_the_game": "Against the &quot;smart germs&quot; of tomorrow's biowarfare, nanites will be our drone soldiers, but for how long? Enter the fluid living world of Cell (built from &quot;dynamic voxels&quot;) to witness the emergence of new life: YOU, a nanobot who shoots deadly colloids, builds defenses and supercharged weapons, deciphers enemy nanotech -- and, by design, learns.",
            "short_description": "Based on a 3D version of mathematician John Conway's &quot;Game of Life,&quot; the game puts the player in a biological world that is uncannily alive.",
            "supported_languages": "Inglês<strong>*</strong>, Francês, Italiano, Alemão, Espanhol (Espanha), Japonês, Coreano, Russo, Chinês simplificado<br><strong>*</strong>idiomas com suporte total de áudio",
